[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0001","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-10043","title":"Perl Module::Load 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Perl 的 Module::Load 模块在 0.22 版本之前存在路径校验缺陷，当加载的模块名称以 \"::\" 开头时，可绕过 @INC 安全限制加载任意路径的 Perl 模块。攻击者若能控制传递给 load 函数的模块名参数，即可利用此漏洞加载恶意模块并执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响所有使用受影响版本 Module::Load 的 Perl 应用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-10043"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-07T12:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-07T17:16:31Z","remediation":"立即将 Perl 的 Module::Load 模块升级至 0.22 或更高版本。在升级不可行时，对传递给 load 函数的模块名进行校验，拒绝以 \"::\" 开头的字符串。同时审查调用链，确保用户输入不会直接或间接影响模块名参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blogs.perl.org/users/michael_g_schwern/2011/10/how-not-to-load-a-module-or-bad-interfaces-make-good-people-do-bad-things.html","https://metacpan.org/release/BINGOS/Module-Load-0.22/changes","https://metacpan.org/release/BINGOS/Module-Load-0.22/diff/BINGOS/Module-Load-0.20/lib/Module/Load.pm"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0023","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-10034","title":"IRAI AUTOMGEN 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IRAI AUTOMGEN 8.0.0.7 及之前版本（含 8.022）在处理项目文件时存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。程序在处理特定畸形字段时先释放对象对象，随后解引用已释放的悬空指针，导致攻击者可通过控制内存内容影响间接函数调用。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的项目文件触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务，特定条件下可导致远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2011-10034"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"2025-11-12T22:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:28:30Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 IRAI AUTOMGEN 8.0.0.7 及更早版本。原始发现者指出厂商未发布官方补丁，建议升级到 IRAI AUTOMGEN 最新可用版本（应高于 8.0.0.7/8.022），避免打开来源不可信的 .agz 项目文件，以低权限用户运行软件降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://en.iraifrance.com/automgen","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17964","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/irai-automgen-use-after-free-remote-dos","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2011/CVE-2011-10034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2011/10xxx/CVE-2011-10034.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/593bdbc51deef90595839eb5f1cfcb624c57384b/2011/10xxx/CVE-2011-10034.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2011.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-10034.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-9c6v-5c62-gv3h/GHSA-9c6v-5c62-gv3h.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/SSVC/data/2011/CVE-2011-10034.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/47961a7a630399deca5847aeb648cf2a0a9c6cd6/CNAReports/VulnCheck.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-10034.json","https://github.com/EMBA-support-repos/EPSS-data/blob/60a4724a863b131d9cf59694b25038cb5525c917/EPSS_CVE_data/CVE_2011_EPSS.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0012","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4336","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9180,\"outputTokens\":34,\"totalTokens\":10878}}","description":"Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 7.0 版本在 web 页面生成过程中，对 snarf_ajax.php 通过 GET 方式传入的 \"ajax\" 参数未做充分的转义与过滤处理，导致存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于该参数内容被直接回显至响应页面，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 脚本的特制 URL 诱骗受害者访问，从而在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，可能窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 7.0 及相邻版本，攻击条件仅需受害者点击恶意链接且无需任何权限，利用方式简单，危害等级为中等（CVSS 6.1）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4336"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-01-15T14:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:47Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 至 7.1 或更高版本（官方已修复该 XSS 漏洞），或手动修补 snarf_ajax.php 对 ajax 参数进行 htmlspecialchars 转义处理。若暂不能升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含脚本标签的 ajax 参数请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2011/Nov/140","https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48806/info","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35974","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4336.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4336.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4336.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14c8304a12469a26a8cf0f12d33579256a31685e/cves/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4336.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2011-4336_2.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-4336.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2011-4336-2066.yaml","https://github.com/Esonhugh/Nuclei-Template-Backup/blob/54b467011a4028fb000da507697200f3ffcdaa0b/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4336.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-4336-2066.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2011-4336-2065.yaml","https://github.com/7RU7H/CTFs/blob/dc835283b6e68fb380c3831f986baee50e6ab88a/OS-ProvingGrounds/DVR4/nuclei/CVE-2011-4336-http___192.168.198.179_8080_snarf_ajax.php_url=1&ajax=%253C%252Fscript%253E%253Cscript%253Ealert%2528document.domain%2529%253C%252Fscript%253E.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0006","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2523","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9148,\"outputTokens\":25,\"totalTokens\":10837}}","description":"vsftpd 2.3.4 版本在 2011 年 6 月 30 日至 7 月 3 日期间被植入恶意后门，该后门会在目标主机上监听 6200/tcp 端口并开放一个 root 权限的 shell。攻击者只需向 FTP 服务的登录用户名中注入特定笑脸字符 \":)\" 即可触发后门，在未授权的情况下远程执行任意命令，导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响在此期间下载安装的 vsftpd 2.3.4 版本，CVSS 评分为 9.8（严重），任何能够访问目标 FTP 服务及其 6200 端口的网络攻击者均可利用此漏洞获取系统最高权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2523"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-11-27T21:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:30Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 vsftpd 至 2.3.5 或更高版本（官方已发布修复版本）。若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙层面封禁 6200/tcp 端口防止后门连接，并检查系统是否已被植入恶意代码。同时建议从官方站点 https://security.appspot.com/vsftpd.html 重新下载验证过的源码包编译安装，避免使用 2011年6月30日至7月3日期间下载的被篡改版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162145/vsftpd-2.3.4-Backdoor-Command-Execution.html","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/cve-2011-2523","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/102745/VSFTPD-2.3.4-Backdoor-Command-Execution.html","https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2011-2523","https://vigilance.fr/vulnerability/vsftpd-backdoor-in-version-2-3-4-10805","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/11/5","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17491","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2523.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-2523.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9f792687ed156d63344016f8bf658946079fb494/pkg/protocols/gox/CVE-2011-2523.go","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b19933d8753463987b80b588cdb9781b0e8db158/data/2011/CVE-2011-2523-hklabCR_CVE-2011-2523.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/87dcdfe4f6eb5023fa62114fe63c7de74d761be5/2011/CVE-2011-2523/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2523","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2011/CVE-2011-2523.rules","https://github.com/ivre/ivre/blob/da1a2f5a0f0896151349e2464d52de3a80eaf811/ivre/db/elastic.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-2523.md","https://github.com/NitinSukthe-G/OpenVAS-Vulnerability-Assessment-Incident-Response/blob/5bc5bca41653030e998c71951b1e9edcde8c63d5/Docs/CVE-2011-2523-Research.md","https://github.com/samugit83/redamon/blob/1fc034438ee11c3bc4149a5546b35dd3adbd8c43/agentic/prompts/base.py","https://github.com/padsalatushal/CVE-2011-2523","https://github.com/Lynk4/CVE-2011-2523","https://github.com/BolivarJ/CVE-2011-2523","https://github.com/4m3rr0r/CVE-2011-2523-poc","https://github.com/nobodyatall648/CVE-2011-2523"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0011","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3600","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9191,\"outputTokens\":21,\"totalTokens\":10876}}","description":"Apache OFBiz 的 /webtools/control/xmlrpc 接口所使用的 XML-RPC 事件处理器在处理 XML 请求时未对外部实体（XXE）进行限制，存在 XML 外部实体注入漏洞（CWE-611）。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向该接口发送携带恶意 DOCTYPE 声明的特制 XML-RPC 请求，即可利用外部实体引用读取目标服务器文件系统中的敏感文件内容，探测开放的网路端口，并可通过服务端返回的错误信息判断特定文件是否存在。该漏洞影响 Apache OFBiz 16.11.01 至 16.11.04 版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5（高危），攻击条件仅需网络可达目标服务并能够发送构造的 XML 请求，利用方式简便且可造成信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3600"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-11-26T01:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache OFBiz 至 16.11.05 或更高版本（受影响版本：16.11.01 至 16.11.04）。如暂时无法升级，可在 webtools/WEB-INF/web.xml 中禁用 XML-RPC servlet（注释掉 xmlrpc servlet 及其映射），或在防火墙层面限制 /webtools/control/xmlrpc 端点的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/ofbiz-user/201810.mbox/%3Cfad45546-af86-0293-9ea7-014553474b30%40apache.org%3E","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/cve-2011-3600","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=CVE-2011-3600","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/7793319ae80ec350f7b82a8763460944f120ebe447f14a12155d0550%40%3Ccommits.ofbiz.apache.org%3E","https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2011-3600","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3600.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3600.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3600.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3600","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2011/CVE-2011-3600.rules","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3600.poc","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3600","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3ff6a73162d852f34c14a0105fd7d93a0a7368b2/2011/CVE-2011-3600.json","https://github.com/apache/ofbiz-site/blob/ece4ac44dd52f389ab174f63e2cf705c1388c72c/security.html","https://github.com/Ma3k4H3d/XuanWu_SecNews/blob/ddf0003ff2a694905bd444868a00150c9d0d2380/2018/10/xuanwu-2018-10-16.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-3600_7.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0014","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4624","title":"Codeasily GRAND FlAGallery WordPress 插件 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"WordPress GRAND FlAGallery 插件（flash-album-gallery）1.57 版本前的 facebook.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的 i 参数诱导用户访问，导致浏览器执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 1.55 及更早版本插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，可窃取用户会话 Cookie、重定向至钓鱼页面或植入恶意软件。CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），升级至 1.57 或更高版本可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4624"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-10-01T14:55:09Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:10Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GRAND FlAGallery 插件至 1.57 版本或更高版本，可在 WordPress 后台插件页面直接更新。若无法立即更新，建议暂时禁用该插件或删除 wp-content/plugins/flash-album-gallery/facebook.php 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2011-12/0180.html","http://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/469785","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/flash-album-gallery/changelog/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/12/23/2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520691/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520704/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50861","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4624.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4624.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4624.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/C