337","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520625/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50779","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/71468","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36339","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5265.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2011/CVE-2011-5265.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5265.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-5265.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-5265-2124.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-5265.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-5265_18.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2011/5xxx/CVE-2011-5265.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2011-5265-2124.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2011-5265-2119.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/13/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0024.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0013","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4618","title":"Simplerealtytheme WordPress Advanced Text Widget 插件 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"WordPress Advanced Text Widget 插件 2.0.2 之前版本的 advancedtext.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过 page 参数注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。该漏洞影响 WordPress Advanced Text Widget 插件 2.0.2 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，属于中危级别。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意 page 参数诱导用户访问，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本代码，可导致会话劫持、网页篡改或钓鱼攻击。WordPress 插件官方已在 2.0.2 版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4618"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-01-24T01:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:09Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WordPress Advanced Text Widget 插件升级至 2.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 advancedtext.php 中 page 参数的 XSS 漏洞。可通过 WordPress 后台“插件-已安装插件”页面点击“立即更新”，或手动下载最新版覆盖安装。如暂时无法更新，可暂时禁用该插件或在 Web 应用防火墙配置针对 page 参数的 XSS 过滤规则作为临时缓解。升级后请清理浏览器缓存并验证页面参数不再回显未转义脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-04/0119.html","http://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?reponame=&new=466102%40advanced-text-widget&old=465828%40advanced-text-widget","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/advanced-text-widget/changelog/","http://wordpress.org/support/topic/wordpress-advanced-text-widget-plugin-cross-site-scripting-vulnerabilities","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/12/19/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520589","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50744","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/71412","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36324","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4618.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4618.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4618.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-4618.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-4618-2069.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/35031eb01c62196cdf3d0ab39832b521dc49b744/nuclei-templates/2011/CVE-2011-4618-advanced_text_widget-c5e011d3-bd0f-46cb-9fb1-af06bcb7e307.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2011-4618-2067.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2011-4618_4.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2011-4618-2068.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2011/CVE-2011-4618.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0022","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-5252","title":"Orchard 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Orchard 是一个基于 ASP.NET MVC 的开源内容管理系统（CMS）。其 Users/Account/LogOff 页面中的 ReturnUrl 参数存在开放重定向漏洞，由于程序对用户输入的 URL 参数未进行充分校验，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意链接，诱导已登录用户点击后将其重定向到任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击以窃取用户凭据。该漏洞影响 Orchard 1.0.21 之前、1.1.31 之前、1.2.42 之前及 1.3.10 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-5252"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-01-12T04:33:48Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:36:13Z","remediation":"升级 Orchard CMS 至修复版本：1.0.x 升级到 1.0.21 及以上、1.1.x 升级到 1.1.31 及以上、1.2.x 升级到 1.2.42 及以上、1.3.x 升级到 1.3.10 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 `ReturnUrl` 参数进行白名单校验，仅允许跳转到本站域名内的 URL，或移除该参数的重定向功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-01/0023.html","http://orchard.codeplex.com/discussions/283667","http://secunia.com/advisories/47398","http://www.mavitunasecurity.com/open-redirection-vulnerability-in-orchard/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51260","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72110","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36493","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5252.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2011/CVE-2011-5252.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5252.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2011/5xxx/CVE-2011-5252.json","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5252.poc","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2011-5252_1.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2011-5252.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-5252","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-5252_16.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2011-5252.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/5xxx/CVE-2011-5252.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0065","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-1374","title":"Apple QuickTime PICT缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理 PICT 文件中的 REGION 记录时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送精心构造的 PICT 文件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 QuickTime 7.7.3 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 9.3，危害等级为高危。攻击条件为受害者打开或预览恶意 PICT 文件，利用方式是通过 REGION 记录中的超长数据触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并劫持程序执行流程。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1374"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-11-09T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:29:14Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.7.3 或更高版本，可通过 Mac App Store 软件更新或访问 Apple 官网下载安装。如无法立即升级，应避免打开来源不明的 PICT 图像文件，并在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Nov/msg00002.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51226","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5581","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15782","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-1374","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2011/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1374.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2011-1374.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-13xx/CVE-2011-1374.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0015","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4640","title":"SpamTitan WebTitan logs-x.php 路径遍历漏洞","description":"SpamTitan WebTitan 3.60 之前版本的 logs-x.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程已认证攻击者可通过在 view 动作的 fname 参数中使用 ..（点点）序列遍历目录，读取服务器上任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 SpamTitan WebTitan 3.60 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.0，属于 CWE-22 路径遍历类漏洞。攻击者需具备认证权限，通过构造包含目录遍历序列的 fname 参数即可读取服务器敏感文件，ExploitDB 已有公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4640"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-10-08T10:47:44Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SpamTitan WebTitan 至 3.60 或更高版本，官方已在 3.60 版本修复该路径遍历漏洞。若暂无法升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙拦截包含 ../ 的 fname 参数请求，或在 Web 服务器配置中限制 logs-x.php 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.sec-1.com/blog/?p=211","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37943","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4640.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4640.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4640.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14c8304a12469a26a8cf0f12d33579256a31685e/cves/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-4640","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2011/CVE-2011-4640.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2011-4640_2.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa4c91178679b1e487def04f4366893d4742edd7/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-4640.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-4640_21.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/979579ffd61606c64cf772a1e865f5126788e4ec/2011.tsv","https://github.com/MrGainn/cve_lmm_data/blob/aa3bc3868615f42a15c798c35de39dfb9bc4bbb1/extra/LLM_All_cves/Phi-4_Mini/correctly_classified.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0021","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-5181","title":"WordPress ClickDesk Live Support 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"WordPress ClickDesk Live Support 2.0 插件的 clickdesk.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过 cdwidgetid 参数注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。该漏洞影响 ClickDesk Live Support 2.0 版本，远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过构造恶意 cdwidgetid 参数诱导用户访问，导致浏览器执行恶意脚本，可窃取用户会话、窃取敏感信息或进行钓鱼攻击。CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），属于 CWE-79 跨站脚本漏洞类别。WordPress 站点若安装了受影响版本的 ClickDesk Live Support 插件均受影响，建议升级至修复版本或禁用该插件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-5181"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-09-20T10:55:26Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:36:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ClickDesk Live Support 插件至 2.0.1 或更高版本（官方已修复该 XSS 漏洞），或通过 WordPress 后台禁用并删除该插件。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置拦截包含 <script>、onerror、onload 等 XSS 特征的 cdwidgetid 参数请求，或在 nginx/Apache 配置层面拦截包含该参数的恶意请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/77338","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/clickdesk-live-support-chat-plugin/changelog/","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520624/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50778","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/71469","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36338","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5181.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-5181.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5181.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-5181.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-5181-2116.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2011-5181-8491a0a59b643c19df3fee90d0e2a8a9.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2011-5181-2114.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14c8304a12469a26a8cf0f12d33579256a31685e/cves/2011/5xxx/CVE-2011-5181.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2011-5181-2113.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/18/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/cve-2011-5181-2116.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0020","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-5179","title":"Skysa Skysa App Bar Integration 插件 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Skysa App Bar Integration 插件 1.2 及之前版本的 skysa.php 文件中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 submit 参数提交恶意脚本代码，注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。该漏洞影响 WordPress 网站使用该插件的用户，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，诱导受害者访问包含恶意脚本的页面即可触发 XSS 攻击，窃取用户会话 Cookie、重定向至钓鱼页面或执行恶意操作。CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），属于 CWE-79 跨站脚本漏洞类别。WordPress 官方插件库已更新至 1.04 版本修复该漏洞，建议用户及时升级至最新版本并清理受感染页面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-5179"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-09-20T10:55:23Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:36:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Skysa App Bar Integration 插件至 1.04 版本或更高版本，该版本已修复 submit 参数的 XSS 漏洞。如暂时无法升级，建议暂时禁用该插件，或在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 配置规则过滤 submit 参数中的脚本标签和事件处理器（如 <script>、onerror、onload 等）作为临时缓解措施。建议同时更新 WordPress 核心及所有插件至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520662/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50824","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/71486","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36363","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5179.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-5179.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5179.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-5179.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/c8e5b5fa7d3cc58de338ca5a0a33eeafcde1afac/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-51xx/CVE-2011-5179.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2011-5179-2108.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2011-5179-2107.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-5179.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14c8304a12469a26a8cf0f12d33579256a31685e/cves/2011/5xxx/CVE-2011-5179.json","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/15/Reports/xssReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0017","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4926","title":"WordPress Adminimize插件 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"WordPress Adminimize 插件 1.7.22 版本前存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 adminimize/adminimize_page.php 文件的 page 参数处理逻辑中。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的 page 参数值，诱导管理员点击恶意链接，导致浏览器在 WordPress 后台上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，进而窃取管理员会话、篡改后台内容或执行管理操作。该漏洞影响 WordPress Adminimize 插件 1.7.22 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），攻击需用户交互且需管理员权限上下文。官方已在 1.7.22 版本修复，建议升级至最新版本并避免点击不可信链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4926"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-29T04:39:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WordPress Adminimize 插件至 1.7.22 或更高版本，该版本已修复 page 参数 XSS 漏洞。如暂时无法升级，建议暂时禁用 Adminimize 插件，或在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 配置 XSS 过滤规则拦截恶意 page 参数载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?reponame=&new=467338%40adminimize&old=466900%40adminimize#file5","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/adminimize/changelog/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/01/05/10","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/01/10/9","http://www.osvdb.org/77472","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520591","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520591/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50745","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/71414","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36325","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4926.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4926.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4926.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-4926.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-4926-2090.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4926.json","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2011-4926-2091.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2011-4926-2089.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2011-4926-2090.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-4926_45.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Apr/02/Reports/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0019","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-5107","title":"WordPress Alert Before Your Post 插件 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"WordPress Alert Before You Post 插件 0.1.1 及更早版本的 post_alert.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，由于对 name 参数缺乏输入过滤与输出编码，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 name 参数诱导管理员点击，导致在管理员浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 WordPress Alert Before Your Post 插件 0.1.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），攻击需诱导管理员访问恶意链接且需用户交互，CVE-2011-5107 对应 CWE-79 跨站脚本弱点类型。WordPress 官方插件库已下架该插件，建议卸载或升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-5107"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-23T20:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WordPress Alert Before You Post 插件至 0.1.2 或更高版本（如有发布），或彻底禁用并删除该插件。若无法立即更新，可通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置规则拦截包含 `<script>`、`onerror=`、`onload=` 等 XSS 特征的 `name` 参数请求，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 `Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'self'` 限制内联脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520590/100/0